WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:17,130
Why are you making such a noise so early in the morning?

2
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:18,530
I just want to borrow some soy sauce

3
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:19,530
not on purpose

4
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:21,530
You little young one

5
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:23,410
Not seventy or eighty

6
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,810
So lazy

7
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:26,450
Go buy it yourself

8
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:27,890
There must be no more noise

9
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:41,820
I bumped into their family coming back last night

10
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:45,320
He just stared at me and wanted to silence me.

11
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,720
Still a cliché

12
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,020
No matter what kind

13
00:00:50,610 --> 00:00:54,620
We can't live here anymore. Stock up. Stock up.
